<title>USA: Fidelity Bancorp sets 10 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Bancorp sets 10 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Bancorp Inc, parent of Fidelity Savings Bank, said its board has declared a 10 percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable May 28, to stockholders of record on May 15, it said.</p>
<p>Fidelity said its board also declared a $0.09 quarterly cash dividend, payable on May 30, to stockholders of record on May 15.</p>
</text>
